 fiume Missouri e fino all'Iowa, da dove verranno rispedite negli stati dell'Est da cui provengono.  Mary Bee carica le tre donne su una diligenza che pare una prigione e si prepara a partire. Ma sa di non potercela fare da sola, e ingaggia un vagabondo cui ha salvato la vita, e che dice di chiamarsi George Biggs. Insieme, George e Mary Bee si avventurano lungo un viaggio impervio e ricco di incognite. Riusciranno nella loro missione (quasi) impossibile?"},{"language":"en-US","overview":"When three women living on the edge of the American frontier are driven mad by harsh pioneer life, the task of saving them falls to the pious, independent-minded Mary Bee Cuddy. Transporting the women by covered wagon to Iowa, she soon realizes just how daunting the journey will be, and employs a low-life drifter, George Briggs, to join her. The unlikely pair and the three women head east, where a waiting minister and his wife have offered to take the women in. But the group first must traverse the harsh Nebraska Territories marked by stark beauty, psychological peril and constant threat."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lBlZgnqCKdcCfj5B6coMX10yJUD.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dXLs7RiKzFlD1clG4PrRYxN3g68.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":264656,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"en-US","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lBlZgnqCKdcCfj5B6coMX10yJUD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lBlZgnqCKdcCfj5B6coMX10yJUD.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lBlZgnqCKdcCfj5B6coMX10yJUD.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lBlZgnqCKdcCfj5B6coMX10yJUD.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"po